WEBVTT

00:02.350 --> 00:04.950
<i>Around the middle of the 21st century,</i>

00:04.950 --> 00:09.970
<i>war had disappeared from the 
small circle floating in the darkness.</i>

00:15.090 --> 00:20.010
<i>People with superhuman strength 
suddenly appeared all around the world,</i>

00:20.010 --> 00:22.300
<i>wished for peace, and worked really hard!</i>

00:29.680 --> 00:32.780
<i>Just where did they come from, and how?</i>

00:33.310 --> 00:35.350
<i>We can talk about that later.</i>

00:37.250 --> 00:42.980
<i>But they all dressed in a rather 
unique and embarrassing manner,</i>

00:42.980 --> 00:46.990
<i>so people just referred to them 
in the good-old-fashioned way...</i>

00:49.680 --> 00:50.810
<i>"Heroes."</i>

01:01.650 --> 01:04.500
E-Everyone...

01:04.500 --> 01:07.500
Greet Guests (10 min)

01:04.500 --> 01:07.500
Shy-san appears

01:04.500 --> 01:07.500
Shy: (Energetically) Everyone, hello!

01:04.500 --> 01:07.500
Shy: (Wait for guests to say "Hello!"; acknowledge)

01:04.500 --> 01:07.500
Shy: I'm a hero in Japan. My name is Shy.

01:05.410 --> 01:07.500
H-H-Hello...

01:07.500 --> 01:13.010
<b>[Breaking] Century Brilliantly Catches Falling Plane...</b>

01:08.180 --> 01:10.050
Hello...

01:11.530 --> 01:13.530
Um, uh...

01:13.010 --> 01:17.010
<b>Fighting Back Against a Band of Robbers! 
 All the Details of the Hostage Rescue</b>

01:14.370 --> 01:17.820
I work as a hero in Japan and...

01:14.880 --> 01:19.010
<i>We are now arriving at 
Himawari Land, Himawari Land.</i>

01:17.010 --> 01:19.020
<b>Special Issue
The Misty Airy Hero
Spirit</b>

01:19.240 --> 01:21.310
<i>The doors on the right side will open.</i>

01:19.520 --> 01:21.870
Teru, aren't you getting off here?

01:25.770 --> 01:26.980
I-I'm so sorry!

01:28.370 --> 01:31.860
<i>The world was in an age where 
people longed for true peace,</i>

01:31.860 --> 01:35.100
<i>where everyone wished for 
peace and good fortune.</i>

01:35.100 --> 01:36.490
To the right. The right.

01:36.490 --> 01:42.040
<i>To make this wish come true, 
heroes appeared in many countries.</i>

01:37.290 --> 01:39.580
Stardust is so awesome.

01:39.580 --> 01:42.040
He's a total hero.

01:42.490 --> 01:45.740
<i>Even in Japan...</i>

01:48.400 --> 01:49.420
I see it.

01:57.130 --> 02:03.640
<b><u>Episode 1</u>
I'm Shy</b>

02:03.930 --> 02:04.680
Um...

02:05.360 --> 02:07.690
Um... E-Everyone...

02:08.530 --> 02:11.190
H-H-H-Hello!

02:11.480 --> 02:13.750
Hi!

02:13.750 --> 02:16.070
Hello.

02:14.220 --> 02:16.070
Hi.

02:16.470 --> 02:21.570
Um... I work as a hero in Japan...

02:22.640 --> 02:28.040
M-My name is Shy. I-It's nice to meet you...

02:25.170 --> 02:28.040
<b>Shy</b>

02:25.170 --> 02:28.040
<b>Japan's Hero</b>

02:28.040 --> 02:29.910
Look, they're called "Heartman"!

02:28.040 --> 02:31.170
A real hero from Japan, "Shy," 
will be here to show support!

02:28.040 --> 02:31.170
<b>Hero Show</b>

02:29.910 --> 02:31.170
Hey!

02:29.910 --> 02:33.540
Today, we're here at Heartman's hero show...

02:31.170 --> 02:33.540
<b>A real hero from Japan, "Shy," 
will be here to show support!</b>

02:34.250 --> 02:37.380
A-And they invited me as a guest...

02:35.950 --> 02:37.380
I'm hungry.

02:38.020 --> 02:41.600
I've been watching Heartman 
ever since I was little...

02:41.600 --> 02:43.840
Hey, when's Heartman gonna be here?

02:43.840 --> 02:45.120
Um...

02:45.120 --> 02:46.720
This is boring!

02:46.720 --> 02:47.760
I gotta poop.

02:47.760 --> 02:49.690
Hurry up!

02:50.050 --> 02:54.690
O-Oh, right... Of course. I'm sorry.

02:55.030 --> 02:58.320
W-Well, I think it's going to start soon, so...

02:58.320 --> 03:00.200
S-See you later, everyone...

03:01.190 --> 03:04.410
Shy! You can do it!

03:07.040 --> 03:08.910
Th-Thanks...

03:09.550 --> 03:12.670
And now, the moment you've all 
been waiting for: Heartman!

03:14.770 --> 03:16.100
Great job.

03:16.100 --> 03:17.070
Thanks...

03:17.810 --> 03:19.280
Uh, I need your mic.

03:19.280 --> 03:20.670
Th-Th-Th-Thanks!

03:20.670 --> 03:28.700
A real hero from Japan, "Shy," 
will be here to show support!

03:20.670 --> 03:28.700
<b>Here</b>

03:21.150 --> 03:24.350
Doki Doki Heartful Attack!

03:25.180 --> 03:28.540
Heartwarming...

03:31.960 --> 03:32.950
Great job today!

03:32.350 --> 03:34.810
<b>Shy-sama
 Greenroom</b>

03:32.950 --> 03:34.810
You, too.

03:40.930 --> 03:43.480
I... I fweel sho shick...

03:44.160 --> 03:45.820
<b>Shy
Real name: Teru Momijiyama.
So shy that she could die</b>

03:46.400 --> 03:48.400
I guess some things never change, Teru.

03:50.280 --> 03:52.250
A-ABO-san...

03:53.120 --> 03:55.750
<b>N. Vilio
Like a partner to Shy
Nickname is "ABO"</b>

03:53.120 --> 03:55.750
It's been three months 
since you became a hero.

03:56.500 --> 03:58.490
You need to get used to people looking at you.

04:00.790 --> 04:03.470
I'll never get used to that.

04:05.590 --> 04:06.640
What's that?

04:06.640 --> 04:07.420
What was that?!

04:07.420 --> 04:08.500
That didn't sound right!

04:08.500 --> 04:09.350
That looks bad!

04:09.350 --> 04:10.850
Someone call for help!

04:12.680 --> 04:15.350
S-Sis, I'm really scared...

04:15.900 --> 04:19.090
D-Don't worry. Someone will save us soon—

04:22.020 --> 04:24.640
Why is this happening?

04:27.850 --> 04:30.660
We'll be... okay...

04:33.540 --> 04:36.000
Y-You're safe now.

04:36.880 --> 04:38.790
Whoa, it's Shy!

04:39.470 --> 04:42.930
I-I'll get you down. Just grab my hand.

04:42.930 --> 04:44.170
Um...

04:44.520 --> 04:48.150
Could you prioritize everyone else before me?

04:48.150 --> 04:50.680
Huh? B-But...

04:51.520 --> 04:56.110
You're gonna save everyone anyway, 
so the order doesn't matter.

04:57.320 --> 04:58.750
All right...

04:59.860 --> 05:00.770
There we go.

05:01.030 --> 05:03.360
He's a huge fan of yours.

05:03.360 --> 05:05.200
Give him some fan service, okay?

05:08.070 --> 05:10.780
<i>She's pretty tough, considering 
the situation she's in.</i>

05:11.180 --> 05:16.200
O-Okay, it might feel like your stomach's 
in your chest, but hang in there for me.

05:16.200 --> 05:16.900
Huh?

05:25.260 --> 05:26.700
Okay, next!

05:35.860 --> 05:37.390
Thanks, Shy.

05:41.400 --> 05:42.550
Okay.

05:42.550 --> 05:43.900
That girl's the only one left.

05:45.630 --> 05:46.650
Don't tell me...

05:50.280 --> 05:51.700
Oh, n—

06:18.010 --> 06:19.600
Whoa, she caught it!

06:19.600 --> 06:21.740
Amazing! Thank goodness!

06:23.550 --> 06:26.790
That was close. I somehow made it in time.

06:30.880 --> 06:32.280
A-Are you o—

06:36.240 --> 06:37.220
Huh?

06:44.840 --> 06:52.550
<b>Continuing Story: 1 Person in Serious Condition 
After Roller Coaster Accident at Himawari Land</b>

06:46.520 --> 06:51.120
<i>We've received a report that Iko Koishikawa-san, 
who was taken to the hospital</i>

06:51.120 --> 06:54.310
<i>following the accident that occurred at 
Himawari Land around 11 AM yesterday,</i>

06:52.550 --> 06:54.600
Iko Koishikawa-san (14)

06:54.310 --> 06:58.250
<i>has yet to regain consciousness 
and is in serious condition.</i>

