07:52.800 --> 07:58.840
I understand how you feel, but there are 
people all over Japan who need your help.

07:59.790 --> 08:03.960
I-I can't, though. I'm 
just gonna mess up again.

07:59.790 --> 08:07.420
<b>Shy's true identity
Teru Momijiyama (14)</b>

08:03.960 --> 08:07.420
I'll get someone badly hurt again, 
and everyone will make fun of me.

08:07.750 --> 08:08.600
Teru.

08:09.170 --> 08:11.640
Only a few people are speaking badly about y—

08:11.640 --> 08:12.500
If...

08:12.990 --> 08:16.060
If only there was some other 
hero there that day...

08:16.060 --> 08:18.800
If only I had been able to 
catch that thing better...

08:18.800 --> 08:21.430
If only I had saved her sooner...

08:21.430 --> 08:24.850
If only I were a true hero...

08:26.080 --> 08:29.440
You are way too hard on yourself.

08:32.150 --> 08:33.430
Pepesha-san?

08:33.240 --> 08:36.030
<b>Spirit
Russia's Hero
Real name: Pepesha Andreanova</b>

08:35.900 --> 08:39.170
I heard you've basically become a shut-in.

08:40.020 --> 08:42.770
Er... I wouldn't say a shut-in...

08:42.770 --> 08:45.390
No, but I get it! I really do!

08:45.390 --> 08:47.290
We all experience it when we're young!

08:47.600 --> 08:57.300
I used to think about flying around the world 
like Century to make everyone total drunkards!

08:57.760 --> 09:02.470
Then wars, crimes, and discrimination 
would all seem stupid,

09:02.470 --> 09:06.380
and the whole wide world would be happy!

09:07.310 --> 09:09.060
Um, Pepesha-san...

09:10.850 --> 09:12.720
So why exactly are you here?

09:16.000 --> 09:17.200
I can't remember!

09:18.080 --> 09:20.390
Oh, but don't you worry!

09:20.390 --> 09:22.270
I may have forgotten why I came here,

09:22.270 --> 09:24.600
but I do know what I need to do right now!

09:24.600 --> 09:25.830
Uh-huh...

09:26.240 --> 09:29.450
Teru-chan! Listen to me carefully!

09:30.900 --> 09:34.430
We just can't make everyone 
in the world drunkards!

09:36.190 --> 09:39.000
Even if you drank with 
everyone in this country,

09:39.000 --> 09:42.010
everyone on the other side 
of the world is sober!

09:42.480 --> 09:43.740
You get it, right?

09:46.100 --> 09:47.020
<i>N...</i>

09:48.610 --> 09:50.500
<i>Not in the least!</i>

09:52.730 --> 09:55.730
Wh-What's your deal?!
 I'm seriously troubled here!

09:55.730 --> 09:57.000
Are you teasing me?!

09:57.000 --> 10:00.330
N-No! What I'm trying to say is...

10:01.480 --> 10:05.630
There's no hero who can 
save every single person.

10:05.630 --> 10:06.480
Huh?

10:06.480 --> 10:09.420
But still, you can't stop.

10:10.710 --> 10:13.650
Hold tight to all the brilliance 
you were able to save.

10:13.650 --> 10:17.210
Carry with you all the brilliance you 
weren't able to save, and move forward.

10:17.210 --> 10:19.430
That's what a hero does, right?

10:21.680 --> 10:24.620
Pepesha-san... But I...

10:27.890 --> 10:28.730
Oh?

10:29.040 --> 10:31.410
What? An emergency? It's real dangerous?

10:31.410 --> 10:33.390
But I wanna be with Teru-chan a little longer...

10:33.390 --> 10:35.730
Okay, fine! I'm on my way!

10:36.490 --> 10:40.190
I'm sorry, Teru-chan! I wanted 
to chat with you a little longer...

10:40.190 --> 10:43.090
I'll be back when I remember 
why I really came here, okay?

10:43.090 --> 10:45.030
Bye-bye! Whoo!

10:45.620 --> 10:47.500
G-Goodbye...

10:50.230 --> 10:52.550
Why she really came here?

10:52.550 --> 10:55.000
She's not the best at talking, either.

10:57.780 --> 11:00.260
<i>We can't save every single person...</i>

11:02.090 --> 11:06.690
<i>If I can actually think like that,
will I be able to move forward?</i>

11:12.480 --> 11:14.980
<b></b>Rental Only

11:12.480 --> 11:14.980
<b></b>Classic Film
7 nights 8 days

11:15.760 --> 11:18.660
<i>What did she mean by "carry"?</i>

11:19.490 --> 11:20.970
<i>Did she mean "take responsibility"?</i>

11:21.750 --> 11:24.660
<i>How is that any different 
from what I'm doing now?</i>

11:24.660 --> 11:25.490
Hey.

11:25.850 --> 11:29.850
I haven't seen that hero called 
Shy since that accident.

11:29.850 --> 11:31.060
Wonder what happened to her.

11:31.060 --> 11:32.910
Who knows? Maybe she died.

11:32.910 --> 11:35.920
What? That'd mean there isn't 
a hero in Japan anymore.

11:35.920 --> 11:38.260
I mean, even without one, it's pretty peaceful.

11:38.260 --> 11:39.420
I know, right?

11:46.580 --> 11:49.910
<i>I wonder if I'm going to be like this forever.</i>

11:51.280 --> 11:53.950
<i>Will I always feel like this?</i>

11:59.160 --> 12:00.820
<i>So many sirens...</i>

12:18.840 --> 12:19.650
Shy.

12:21.630 --> 12:25.050
<b>Shy</b>

12:21.630 --> 12:25.050
<b>Real Name: Teru Momijiyama
Nationality: Japan    Likes: Horror movies, natto
The Japanese hero who's so shy she could die</b>

12:26.190 --> 12:29.060
A huge fire has broken out at T-1 Hotel!

12:29.340 --> 12:31.360
There are still people 
trapped on the upper floors!

12:31.360 --> 12:33.060
We won't make it in time!

12:33.860 --> 12:35.560
I have to go.

12:45.680 --> 12:46.740
Why?

12:47.660 --> 12:48.970
<i>But I have to go...</i>

12:50.160 --> 12:51.650
<i>I have to...</i>

12:53.100 --> 12:55.500
H-Hey, you! Get back!

12:55.500 --> 12:57.250
Stop pretending to be a hero!

12:57.680 --> 13:00.120
There's a real fire over there! 
It's dangerous to get any closer!

13:00.120 --> 13:03.970
Even if it's dangerous, 
I have to go save them!

13:04.640 --> 13:08.220
Because Shy... saved me!

13:08.920 --> 13:11.700
This time, I'm going to go save everyone!

13:11.700 --> 13:12.850
<i>A child?</i>

13:13.230 --> 13:15.830
But fire's scary, y'know.

13:15.830 --> 13:18.860
If you want to defeat scary 
things and save people,

13:18.860 --> 13:21.290
anyone can be a hero!

13:23.340 --> 13:24.310
An explosion?!

13:24.310 --> 13:26.060
Hey, the rubble up there!

13:34.880 --> 13:36.630
Did it fall on that boy?!

13:36.630 --> 13:37.790
Is he okay?!

13:38.370 --> 13:40.130
A-Are you okay?

13:41.130 --> 13:43.560
Everyone, stay back! It's dangerous here!

13:43.560 --> 13:46.380
Thank goodness you don't seem hurt.

13:48.490 --> 13:51.390
ABO-san, there's a fire at T-1 Hotel.

13:53.210 --> 13:56.940
Yeah, I'm fine. I'll head in.

13:57.710 --> 14:00.060
M-Miss?

14:00.990 --> 14:02.780
You're exactly right.

14:03.440 --> 14:06.040
The ones who defeat what's scary are heroes.

14:07.320 --> 14:13.010
<i>Man, I'm scared... My hands 
and legs are shaking.</i>

14:14.250 --> 14:16.830
<i>But even I...</i>

14:17.430 --> 14:19.270
<i>want to defeat that.</i>

14:21.340 --> 14:22.130
Because...

14:29.260 --> 14:32.230
Because I'm... Shy!

14:35.790 --> 14:39.390
I'll take it from here, little hero.

14:42.230 --> 14:44.400
Hey! Are you okay?

14:47.490 --> 14:49.650
<i>I'm so stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid!</i>

14:49.650 --> 14:52.310
<i>I'm such an idiot!</i>

14:52.310 --> 14:55.540
<i>I was so worried about myself that 
I couldn't do anything else...</i>

15:00.740 --> 15:04.920
Hello? Is there anyone left up here?!

15:07.930 --> 15:11.320
<i>I can't hear anyone. 
Did they all evacuate already?</i>

15:17.320 --> 15:19.270
<i>There's still someone here!</i>

15:19.270 --> 15:21.490
Wh-Where are you?

15:21.490 --> 15:23.230
I'm here to save you!

15:31.760 --> 15:33.450
A-Are you okay?

15:35.410 --> 15:36.990
<i>There's no pulse!</i>

15:38.210 --> 15:41.250
<i>I f-failed to save someone again...</i>

15:43.170 --> 15:45.670
<i>No! Stop saying that!</i>

15:48.320 --> 15:53.970
<i>What I need to do right now is get this 
person to the paramedics as soon as possible.</i>

15:49.150 --> 15:50.720
It'll be okay.

15:54.980 --> 15:56.970
<i>And then I know...</i>

15:57.430 --> 15:59.470
<i>I know that she'll be okay!</i>

16:14.840 --> 16:15.780
<i>No matter what...</i>

16:17.010 --> 16:18.280
<i>I'm going to save her!</i>

16:22.210 --> 16:24.040
<i>I overused my thruster!</i>

16:24.470 --> 16:25.880
<i>I won't make it in time!</i>

16:29.520 --> 16:31.820
I know you're still a 
little green, Teru-chan...

16:35.520 --> 16:37.580
But don't push yourself too much.

16:38.080 --> 16:39.310
Pepesha-san?!

16:40.060 --> 16:43.700
Welcome back. It's the return of Shy!

16:52.780 --> 16:54.890
Evacuations are done, and the fire's out!

16:53.600 --> 16:54.890
Mom!

16:54.890 --> 16:56.880
Transfer the wounded to 
the hospital immediately!

16:56.880 --> 16:59.030
They're going to Tanpopo Central Hospital!

16:59.610 --> 17:02.290
This is where our work ends.

17:02.290 --> 17:04.450
Let's let them take care of the rest.

17:06.640 --> 17:09.800
What's this? You look like you 
want to save more people.

17:09.800 --> 17:11.800
S-Save more?

17:13.860 --> 17:18.570
I-I mean... I don't even know 
if you can call that "saving"...

17:19.680 --> 17:25.190
<b>Waaaaaaa</b>

17:20.000 --> 17:21.900
Spirit from Russia?!

17:21.900 --> 17:25.190
Why are you in Japan?!
Can I have your autograph?!

17:25.190 --> 17:28.190
<b>Fuss Fuss</b>

17:25.190 --> 17:28.190
Oh, my!

17:26.450 --> 17:28.190
She's so popular...

17:30.950 --> 17:32.530
Shy!

17:33.840 --> 17:37.110
Thanks so much for earlier! 
Oh, and at the amusement park!

17:37.430 --> 17:38.040
Huh?

17:38.660 --> 17:40.700
O-Oh, you're the boy from then!

17:42.710 --> 17:46.380
U-Um, uh... Back then, I...

17:46.380 --> 17:48.530
My sister's out of the hospital now!

17:48.530 --> 17:49.210
Huh?!

17:49.210 --> 17:51.710
She'll be going back to school soon.

17:52.240 --> 17:53.840
So thank you.

17:53.840 --> 17:58.510
For saving me, my sister, and everyone else!

18:03.950 --> 18:06.200
<i>Saving everyone, huh?</i>

18:07.330 --> 18:10.960
<i>Is it really okay for me to think that?</i>

18:11.820 --> 18:13.350
Teru-chan!

18:14.330 --> 18:16.170
You startled me.

18:16.170 --> 18:19.950
So hey, one of the paramedics just told me...

18:20.590 --> 18:23.990
The mother of the baby you found...

18:24.720 --> 18:27.160
She managed to regain consciousness.

18:29.420 --> 18:34.500
No matter what anyone says, you 
were able to save a precious life.

18:35.550 --> 18:38.050
At least that's what I think.

18:40.260 --> 18:41.100
Right...

18:44.110 --> 18:45.100
Right!

18:46.900 --> 18:49.910
Oh, jeez! Why are you crying?

18:49.910 --> 18:52.220
You're supposed to smile at times like this!

18:54.870 --> 18:57.390
Okay, let's get going.

18:57.390 --> 18:59.320
Huh? W-Wait, going where?

18:59.320 --> 19:03.160
I remembered the real reason 
I visited you the other day.

19:03.760 --> 19:07.180
Teru-chan, let's go to outer space together.

19:07.180 --> 19:08.290
Huh?

19:25.810 --> 19:28.180
And just like that, we're in outer space!

19:28.180 --> 19:31.550
U-Um... Where are we?

19:31.550 --> 19:35.120
This is basically a private hideout for heroes.

19:36.080 --> 19:39.190
It's a pleasure to meet you, 
Teru Momijiyama-san.

19:40.160 --> 19:40.950
Rather...

19:41.940 --> 19:43.950
The hero of Japan...

19:44.930 --> 19:45.930
Shy.

19:47.450 --> 19:50.380
It has been three months 
since you became a hero.

19:50.860 --> 19:54.820
I would have loved to meet you sooner.

19:58.080 --> 19:58.710
Um...

20:00.160 --> 20:02.380
Shy? Can you hear me?

20:06.980 --> 20:09.300
Eh? What is the matter?

20:09.300 --> 20:11.390
Well, she's shy.

20:12.010 --> 20:14.400
<i>I was captivated...</i>

20:14.910 --> 20:18.080
And... who might you be, ma'am?

20:18.080 --> 20:22.400
I am the one charged with 
supervising the heroes of Earth...

20:22.700 --> 20:24.930
the Heavenly Empress Unilord.

20:24.370 --> 20:28.370
<b>Unilord</b>

20:24.370 --> 20:28.370
<b>Supervisor to the Heroes</b>

20:24.930 --> 20:26.470
Heavenly Emperor?

20:26.470 --> 20:28.910
There's no need to be so formal.

20:29.840 --> 20:33.580
Please, feel free to call me...

20:35.890 --> 20:37.890
"Yunicchi."

20:43.180 --> 20:44.390
I'm kidding.

20:44.390 --> 20:46.220
<i>She tells jokes?!</i>

20:46.520 --> 20:49.050
Okay, Yunicchi. Let's get down to business!

20:49.050 --> 20:50.290
<i>She really called her that?!</i>

20:51.030 --> 20:54.090
In that case, let me get straight to the point.

20:55.910 --> 20:57.850
In the future,

20:57.850 --> 21:03.310
we will be faced with a grave danger bigger 
than anything we've ever faced before.

21:03.840 --> 21:04.570
Huh?

21:06.430 --> 21:11.500
And that is the exact reason why 
the heroes of Earth have come to be.

21:12.320 --> 21:14.250
Though the world is free of war,

21:14.250 --> 21:20.460
there is a dark place existing in everyone's 
hearts that they do not want seen.

21:21.180 --> 21:24.280
Everyone everywhere.

21:25.800 --> 21:30.130
Those who do not seek the light 
want to take advantage of this.

21:30.780 --> 21:31.730
Shy...

21:32.540 --> 21:33.950
You must understand this.

21:34.500 --> 21:40.180
The duty of a hero is to become 
a beacon of hope for the people,

21:40.670 --> 21:44.820
and to protect the soul of this world.

21:45.110 --> 21:47.550
Protect the soul of the world?

21:48.320 --> 21:52.160
That's our real job as heroes.

21:54.950 --> 21:58.190
<i>An age where everyone wished 
for peace and good fortune...</i>

21:59.320 --> 22:02.170
<i>An age where everyone 
longed for true peace...</i>

22:03.380 --> 22:08.990
<i>This was the age in human history when 
 the soul was the most meaningful.</i>

22:17.170 --> 22:18.980
<i>A threat to the world...</i>

22:19.550 --> 22:21.480
<i>The duty of the heroes...</i>

22:21.840 --> 22:25.650
<i>This whole thing's so huge 
that it doesn't feel real.</i>

22:26.320 --> 22:29.060
<i>What exactly is this threat?</i>

22:29.060 --> 22:30.570
All right, quiet down!

22:30.570 --> 22:34.900
As I mentioned last week, we've got a 
new classmate joining our class today.

22:35.560 --> 22:37.400
Come on in, Koishikawa-san.

22:37.400 --> 22:38.310
Okay.

22:43.410 --> 22:45.050
Hup.

22:47.470 --> 22:55.970
<b>Iko Koishikawa</b>

22:47.750 --> 22:50.660
My name is Iko Koishikawa.

22:50.660 --> 22:54.420
Previously, I went to the private school, 
Karen Middle, in the next town over.

22:54.420 --> 22:55.970
I hope you'll all be kind to me.

22:55.970 --> 22:57.580
She's so pretty!

22:57.580 --> 22:58.620
Karen Middle?!

22:58.620 --> 23:00.130
She's super smart, then.

23:00.130 --> 23:01.690
She has crutches?

23:02.180 --> 23:04.610
Your seat's right over there.

23:04.610 --> 23:05.510
Okay.

23:07.240 --> 23:09.070
<i>Iko Koishikawa-san...</i>

23:09.390 --> 23:10.510
<i>She's...</i>

23:12.790 --> 23:14.480
D-Do you need help?

23:14.480 --> 23:16.950
Oh, I'm fine! Thanks, though.

23:17.390 --> 23:20.620
<i>She's the one Shy couldn't save.</i>

23:26.720 --> 23:27.830
Nice to meet you.

23:30.690 --> 23:34.170
N-Nice to meet you, too...
